    {
      "id": "p0146-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This line is a simple pun on the English word \"blueprints\", but it also contains a reference to Blue's Clues, an American educational television series intended for children. Each episode features a puzzle, and a dog named Blue marks clues with a blue pawprint. The viewer is then asked to locate these clues and use them to solve the puzzle.",
